  m_text: 'Fortune tools let you peek at or change the deck, but each one costs <b>Spirit</b>.

    You start with 3 Spirit. You gain 1 after every reading that is not ruined, and 2 when you meet a night''s Quota. Spirit carries over between customers and nights.

    Using a tool does not draw a card, so you can use several before you decide.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
