  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'You are a fortune teller. Each night, three customers come to you, and the game lasts three nights - nine readings in all.

    In each reading you draw cards to build up the customer''s fortune, and every draw asks the same question: chase more fortune, or fold and keep what you have? Draw too greedily and the reading falls apart. Knowing when to fold is everything.

    Your final score is the total of all nine readings. Each night also has a <b>Quota</b>: missing it does not end the game, but meeting it earns you 2 Spirit.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dfdfbb81a1e632e4e943931cba6a0c09, type: 2}
